cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Membrane Capacity
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-21
authors:
  - family-names: Brisson
    given-names: Jean-François
    orcid: https://orcid.org/0009-0000-9778-5374
license: AGPL-3.0-only
repository-code: https://github.com/sparkainlp-x/membrane-capacity
abstract: >-
  Seeded capacity sweep for a complex outer-product holographic
  memory: random pattern libraries, noisy probes, one-shot
  projection as the classifier. Finds classification capacity far
  above N for random patterns at low noise, and a graceful
  breakdown curve at heavy noise with P90 pinned. Distinguishes
  classification capacity from Hopfield recall capacity; honest
  limits documented.
keywords:
  - holographic-memory
  - capacity
  - complex-hopfield
  - associative-memory
  - wave-computing
